2026/11/17 10:54:45 client_export needs protoc 31.1 to match Google.Protobuf 3.31.1 locked by the Roost C# SDK, but /opt/homebrew/bin/protoc (from PATH) reports "libprotoc 36.2"; install protoc 31.1 from https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf/releases/tag/v31.1 (protoc-31.1-<os>-<arch>.zip), then point client_export.csharp.protoc or the ROOST_PROTOC environment variable at its bin/protoc, or put it first on PATH
